  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jadolo Maduongʼ mar Singruok Manyien",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gima wasebedo ka watemo wacho en ma: Wan gi Jadolo Maduongʼ mobet piny e bat korachwich mar Kom Duongʼ mar Nyasaye Maduongʼ manie polo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en ema otiyo e kama ler mar lemo, ma en Hemb Romo madier ma Ruoth ema oguro, to ok dhano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jadolo Maduongʼ moro amora iyiero mondo ochiw mich kaachiel gi misango, omiyo kata jadolowani bende ne nyaka chiw gimoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dine bed ni pod en e piny ka, to dine ok obedo jadolo, nikech nitie jodolo moromo machiwo mich duto kaka chik dwaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tich ma jodologo tiyo e kama ler mar lemo en mana kido gi tipo mar tij dolo manie polo. Mano emomiyo ka Musa ne dwaro chako gero Hemb Romo to Nyasaye nosieme kawachone niya, \"Ne ni igero gik moko duto machal gi kido mane onyisi ewi got.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To tich ma Yesu oseyudo duongʼ moloyo margino, mana kaka winjruok mokelo, ma en e jathek ber moloyo winjruok machon, nikech en winjruok ma singruok mabeyo moloyo ema guro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dine bed ni onge gima orem kuom winjruok machon, to winjruok manyien ok dobiro kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Nyasaye noneno wach moro morem kuomgi mi owacho niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Kinde biro, Jehova Nyasaye wacho,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ma anatim singruok manyien,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "gi dhood jo-Israel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kod dhood jo-Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Singruokno ok nochal",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "gi mano mane atimo gi kweregi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kane amako lwetgi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "mi atelonegi kagologi e piny Misri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nikech ne ok giluwo singruokna ma natimo kodgi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "omiyo an bende ne alokora aweyogi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye owacho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma e singruok ma anatim gi dhood jo-Israel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "bangʼ ndalogo, Jehova Nyasaye owacho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abiro keto chikena e pachgi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kendo ndikogi e chunygi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Anabed Nyasachgi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kendo ginibed joga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koro ngʼato ok nochak opuonj jabathe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kata nyawadgi kowacho ni, 'Ngʼe Jehova Nyasaye,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nikech giduto giningʼeya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kochakore ngʼat matinie moloyo nyaka ngʼat maduongʼie moloyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimar anawenegi timbegi maricho,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kendo ok anachak apar richogi kendo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Nyasaye luongo singruokni ni \"manyien\" to mano nyiso ni osemiyo singruok mokwongo odoko machon maonge tich; to kaka oonge tich kendo oti, to obiro lal nono machiegni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "HEB.9",
    "number": "9",
